    "A hint shows a move that leads to a win when there is one. Each hint costs 10 points.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una pista muestra una jugada que lleva a ganar, si la hay. Cada pista cuesta 10 puntos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A run in order moves together. Tap the 8♠ to move it with the 7♥ onto the 9♥.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una escalera en orden se mueve completa. Toca el 8♠ para llevarlo con el 7♥ sobre el 9♥."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tapped card goes to its best place.": {
